  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AHRI Core Support 2018/2019 - 2022/2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core support to the implementation of AHRI&apos;s updated Strategic Plan 2016-2020 for the period FY 2018/2019-2022/2023
AHRI&apos;s objectives include strengthening management and governance of the institution for national leadership in health research, including local communities involvements in research projects and dissemination and training of Master and PhD students at partner HEIs in Ethiopia. Gender Equity and recruitment of female candidates into postgraduate education and research is a priority</narrative>
  </description>
